# .env is deliberately NOT ignored here.
#
# Every variable in this project is NEXT_PUBLIC_*, which Next inlines into the
# client bundle — they are already visible to anyone who opens the site, so
# there is nothing secret to leak. It is copied into the build stage only; the
# runtime image is a separate stage and never receives it.
#
# If a non-public variable is ever added to this project, ignore .env again and
# pass build args explicitly instead.
.env.local
.env.*.local
